==Albanian==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|sq|sqj-pro|*pat(i)-}}, from {{der|sq|ine-pro|*poti-o-|t=to be in possession of}}. Cognate to {{cog|la|potior|t=to have a share in, take possession of}}, {{cog|grc|πόσις}}, {{cog|sa|पति|tr=páti}}.<ref>{{R:sq:Orel:1998|page=167}}</ref><ref>{{R:sq:Demiraj|page=}}</ref> A suppletive verb, which occurs in the participle and the aorist, as well as in the tenses and moods derived from these stems.

===Verb===
{{sq-verb|pata|pasur}}

# to have [[had]] {{q|aorist}}
# to have been in [[possession]] {{q|of something}}

====Conjugation====
See {{l|sq|kam||to have}}.

